<div id="app">
<header><h1><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i> RK Smart PDF ↔ JPG </h1><div class="menu-icon"><button id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch theme"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i><span id="themeLabel">Dark</span></button></div></header>
<div class="container"><main class="card">
<h2><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i> PDF ↔ JPG Advanced Converter</h2>
<div class="info"><i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles"></i> Convert multiple JPG images into a PDF or merge multiple PDF files into one JPG image.</div>
