<div class="group"><label>1. <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open"></i> Select images (JPG/PNG) (one or more):</label><input id="jpgInput" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple hidden><div class="upload" id="jpgBox"><i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up" style="font-size:28px;color:#dc2626"></i><span class="upload-title" id="jpgText">Select Images (You can select multiple at once)</span></div></div>
<div class="grid" id="imageGrid"></div>
